{"id":"c076970d49b3d259","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-binary-alphabet-simulation.md","title":"固定有限字母表的常数因子模拟","display":"thm-binary-alphabet-simulation — 固定有限字母表的常数因子模拟","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-binary-alphabet-simulation","aliases":["28-thm-binary-alphabet-simulation"],"display":"thm-binary-alphabet-simulation — 固定有限字母表的常数因子模拟","depends_on":["[[28-df-tm]]","[[28-df-machine-resources]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Claim 1.5 and proof","source_printed_pages":"16–17","source_pdf_pages":"42–43","source_status":"statement-compared-proof-not-fully-reviewed","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-binary-alphabet-simulation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-binary-alphabet-simulation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-binary-alphabet-simulation — 固定有限字母表的常数因子模拟"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Claim 1.5 and proof"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"16–17"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"42–43"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-proof-not-fully-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(T:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(n)\\ge n+1\">\\(T(n)\\ge n+1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\operatorname{time}_M(x)\\le T(|x|)\">\\(\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\operatorname{time}_M(x)\\le T(|x|)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_N\">\\(\\Gamma_N\\)</span> 为机器七元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\in\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(N\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span> 的第三坐标。机器输出与时间见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\widetilde M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\left[\\Gamma_{\\widetilde M}=\\{0,1,\\sqcup,\\lhd,\\rhd\\}\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\left(\\widetilde M(x)=M(x)\\land\\operatorname{time}_{\\widetilde M}(x)\\le cT(|x|)\\right)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\widetilde M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\left[\\Gamma_{\\widetilde M}=\\{0,1,\\sqcup,\\lhd,\\rhd\\}\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\left(\\widetilde M(x)=M(x)\\land\\operatorname{time}_{\\widetilde M}(x)\\le cT(|x|)\\right)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个原字母使用固定长度二进制块，有限控制记录块内位置并模拟读写和移动。块长及模拟状态数仅依赖固定M。本目录保留左、右端标记，故使用5个符号码而非书中四符号变体；两者仅差常数编码。此次核对原书陈述和块模拟思路，未逐条构造转移表。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Claim 1.5 and proof；印刷 pp.16–17 / PDF pp.42–43。本次核对范围：对应陈述；证明边界见本节，未升级为完整证明核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-machine-resources","status":"resolved","id":"b5d4fc2d291ce98b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-machine-resources]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-machine-resources","status":"resolved","id":"b5d4fc2d291ce98b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}$；$T:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$T(n)\\ge n+1$；$\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\operatorname{time}_M(x)\\le T(|x|)$。$\\Gamma_N$ 为机器七元组 $N\\in\\mathrm{TM}$ 的第三坐标。机器输出与时间见 [[28-df-machine-resources]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"T:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"T(n)\\ge n+1","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\operatorname{time}_M(x)\\le T(|x|)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_N","display":false},{"tex":"N\\in\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists\\widetilde M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\left[\\Gamma_{\\widetilde M}=\\{0,1,\\sqcup,\\lhd,\\rhd\\}\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\left(\\widetilde M(x)=M(x)\\land\\operatorname{time}_{\\widetilde M}(x)\\le cT(|x|)\\right)\\right].","display":true}],"bytes":1889,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-272","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-ex-palindrome-linear-time]]、[[28-thm-binary-alphabet-simulation]]、[[28-thm-uncomputable-diagonal-language]]、[[28-df-halting-language]]、[[28-thm-halting-undecidability]]。"}],"outgoing":["1965e2b0765554c9","b5d4fc2d291ce98b"]}